cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and also cite the original
  paper of every circuit you use (see the arxiv_id and url fields in manifest.csv).
type: dataset
title: "arxiv-circuits: key quantum circuits from recent arXiv quant-ph papers"
abstract: >-
  55 quantum circuits from 41 arXiv quant-ph papers submitted between 2026-06-28
  and 2026-10-28, read gate by gate from the quantikz/qcircuit diagrams in the
  papers' LaTeX sources, verified, and published as OpenQASM 2.0 with a manifest
  linking each circuit to its source paper.
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Xusheng
  - name: QuSpect
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-02"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/QuSpect/arxiv-circuits"
url: "https://github.com/QuSpect/arxiv-circuits"
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - quantum circuits
  - OpenQASM
  - benchmark
  - dataset
  - arXiv
